.claude/skills/solvys-build-kit/assets/build-kit/installed-libraries/aceternity-ui/
.claude/skills/solvys-build-kit/assets/build-kit/installed-registries/beui-pro/
.claude/skills/solvys-build-kit/assets/build-kit/installed-registries/aceternity-ui/
